---
import { LinkButton } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
---

<section class="about not-content">
    <h2>What is Kyushu?</h2>

    <p>Kyushu is an open source CLI that lets you write a JavaScript or TypeScript worker, build it into a self-contained WebAssembly binary, and run it anywhere with one command - <code>kyu</code>.</p>

    <ul>
        <li>
            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span><strong>No Node, Bun, or Docker</strong> - just a single binary</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span><strong>Cloudflare Workers-style API</strong> - familiar <code>fetch</code> handler</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span><strong>Self-hostable</strong> - runs on a VPS or anywhere</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span><strong>WebAssembly sandbox</strong> - isolated from the host</span>
        </li>
    </ul>

    <LinkButton href="/getting-started" variant="minimal" icon="right-arrow">Read docs</LinkButton>
</section>

<style>
    .about {
        padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    }

    .about h2 {
        color: var(--sl-color-white);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .about > p {
        font-size: var(--sl-text-body);
        color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        max-width: 60ch;
    }

    .about ul {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0 0 2rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .about li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: var(--sl-text-body);
        color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    }

    .about li svg {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        margin-top: 3px;
        color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    }

    .about li strong {
        color: var(--sl-color-white);
    }

    .about li code {
        font-size: 0.875em;
    }
</style>